      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK Northwest are delighted to bring this beautiful family home to market. Located in the stunning landscape of Bangor Erris, Co.Mayo. The property, set on c. .5 (half) of an acre of mature, landscaped gardens, comprises 5 double bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, a large living room, family kitchen and utility room.\r\n\r\nHaving been meticulously maintained, the property requires no remedial works and is ready to move in. The property boasts a tarmacadam driveway, garage, ample external storage & parking areas and is fronted by manicured mature gardens, lawn and patio area. Maintained to an impeccable standard, this warm and inviting home has double-glazed windows throughout and oil-fired central heating.\r\n\r\nThe town of Bangor Erris is within walking distance and has all amenities to hand such as primary school, a post office, a church, grocery stores, general shops, and traditional pubs and restaurants.\r\n\r\nBangor Erris is positioned on the banks of the Owenmore River and near Carrowmore Lake; it is a renowned destination for fly-fishing and trout angling.\r\n\r\nIreland West Airport: 40 min\r\nCastlebar: 50min\r\nBallina: 35min\r\nNewport: 40min\r\n\r\nMains electricity\r\nMains Sewage\r\nMains water.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a well-presented family home in Bangor Erris. Viewing is highly advised and strictly by appointment with the sole agent. Seeking offers in excess of €350,000.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
